cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the results in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Battery ECM Parameter Identification and Early Cycle-Life Prediction"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible implementation of Thevenin equivalent-circuit model identification
  on the NASA PCoE battery dataset and early cycle-life (RUL) prediction from the
  first 100 cycles on the MIT-Stanford dataset, following the Severson et al. (2019)
  protocol.
